{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852764990027988993","content":"Rules: Hit the target as hard as you can with the oversized hammer provided.  (Make a strength check, no modifier)\n\n 3 tries per day.\n\n\nLimit one of each prize per player.\n\n**Any roll below 15,**\nThe woman gives you a small smile and a pat on the back and says: “Apologies, little comrade, may your muscles do better in future.”\n**DC15**- A tank top with a super strong torso on it (mens or womens)\nDC 19- Nolzur’s magical warpaint 1 dose (paint this on your face and become immune to fear for 1 hour)\nThe woman raises her eyebrow as she takes out your prize. “Not bad, you vould do in  fight against nieces maybe.” She hands you a small vile marked ‘Nolzur’s warpaint- single use’.\n**DC 23**- Gloves of the Goliath (push/drag/lift one size larger)\nThe woman smiles a big smile and before you know what is happening she is slapping you on the back with a force you did not expect. “Impressive vork! You almost strong like me, these help.” She hands you a pair of grey gloves with various black markings.","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:28:59.499000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T18:27:24.979000Z","id":"852766341722144788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
